{"id":"n49965-1-9","stage":3,"title":"막대기 · 棍子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49965-1-9-1","ko":"승규야, 내가 막대기로 나무에 달린 밤송이를 칠게.","zh":"承奎，我用棍子打树上的栗苞。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"막대기로","meaning":"棍子，杆子","explanation":"막대기：棍子，杆子；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"막대기","audio":"/audio/abcdc1128c94ef0ebaaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49965","senseId":"1","lemma":"막대기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막대기로","audio":"/audio/26a6e8b90e9ef47e7f03.mp3"}},{"text":"나무에","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무에","audio":"/audio/d85077cae3dd99e8b044.mp3"}},{"text":"달린","meaning":"结着，挂着","explanation":"달리다：结着，挂着；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"달리다","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61300","senseId":"10","lemma":"달리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달린","audio":"/audio/c62c645fb0f84ec2a00d.mp3"}},{"text":"밤송이를","meaning":"毛栗子","explanation":"밤송이：毛栗子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밤송이","audio":"/audio/c49de8fb9f1757e7b38a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57950","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤송이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤송이를","audio":"/audio/b4c2e55e1bbf4862b8f9.mp3"}},{"text":"칠게.","meaning":"打，敲，击","explanation":"치다：打，敲，击；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칠게","audio":"/audio/1606c25212c43f131533.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"abcdc1128c94ef0e","term":"막대기","zh":"棍子，杆子","audio":"/audio/abcdc1128c94ef0ebaaf.mp3","entryId":"49965","definition":"以木材或铁、玻璃等材料所制成的，细长而坚硬的物品。","pronunciation":["막때기"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"拥有坚硬的茎杆，上面长有枝叶的多年生植物。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"605b9178b6748898","term":"달리다","zh":"结着，挂着","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3","entryId":"61300","definition":"结果实。","pronunciation":["달리다"]},{"id":"c49de8fb9f1757e7","term":"밤송이","zh":"毛栗子","audio":"/audio/c49de8fb9f1757e7b38a.mp3","entryId":"57950","definition":"被带尖刺的厚壳包裹着的栗子；或指其外壳。","pronunciation":["밤ː송이"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打，敲，击","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"用手或其他物品用力碰撞到某物上。","pronunciation":["치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/150eee3beb86b457536a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49965-1-9-2","ko":"형, 그럼 나는 떨어진 밤을 주울게.","zh":"哥，那我来捡掉下来的栗子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형,","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"2","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3